==Battleground==
*1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*10 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage may be a bit hard for those without good low-cost damage, as Nyandam and co spawn almost instantly. Cats such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] are recommended. If you are lucky enough to have any Anti-Aku units at this point of the game, USE THEM. It is recommended to be around the end of [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1 or the beginning of Chapter 2 before attempting this stage.

==Trivia==
*This, [[Otherworld Forest]] and [[Sinister Wasteland]] all use backgrounds from the [[Nazousagi Collaboration Event]].

